  "contentHtml": "<p>담임을 하거나 교과 수업을 할 때 보면 분리배출을 제대로 하지 않는 친구들이 많아 이 수업을 준비하게 되었습니다.</p><p>물론 이 수업 이후에 아이들이 큰 변화가 있는 것은 아니었지만, 그래도 잘못 분리배출 된 것들이 조금씩 줄어들었습니다.</p><p>그래서 저는 1학년 주제 첫 시간을 이 수업으로 진행합니다! 수업은 총 6차시입니다.</p><p>조 활동에서 역할이 치우치는 경우도 꽤 있었지만 ㅜㅜ 그래도 대부분 즐겁게 활동하였습니다.</p><p>활동이 끝난 후 자기평가서+조원 평가서 작성하여 아이들의 참여도를 확인하였습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1차시-지켜츄 분리배출 모의고사+지켜츄 영상보기</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7vsHVk-9fmo&amp;t=29s\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7vsHVk-9fmo&amp;t=29s</a></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/386f53ab97e24fa5c84645dfe5e966c74b6ebab9_re_1715223949844?download\" data-file-name=\"분리배출.pptx\" data-file-size=\"409003\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansoftpptx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DdSQv%26dataid%3D329%26fileid%3D6%26regdt%3D20240514091110&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F386f53ab97e24fa5c84645dfe5e966c74b6ebab9_re_1715223949844')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">분리배출</span><span class=\"type\">.pptx</span></div><div class=\"size\">399.42KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/266a5b789bf5851c3171c901864d30669bc683a1_re_1715223949844?download\" data-file-name=\"분리배출 모의고사(지켜츄).hwpx\" data-file-size=\"2448552\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DdSQv%26dataid%3D329%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20240514091110&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F266a5b789bf5851c3171c901864d30669bc683a1_re_1715223949844')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">분리배출 모의고사(지켜츄)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.34MB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>2차시-분리배출 영상보면서 프린트 채우기</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YHdJq7MpFXQ\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YHdJq7MpFXQ</a></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/18ce20a16e945057a5ed16a2e740b135af1419da_re_1715223949844?download\" data-file-name=\"분리배출.hwp\" data-file-size=\"68608\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DdSQv%26dataid%3D329%26fileid%3D9%26regdt%3D20240514091110&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F18ce20a16e945057a5ed16a2e740b135af1419da_re_1715223949844')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">분리배출</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">67.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/775b51c2b6443b39efa75299fc7bf15b41347a04_re_1715223949844?download\" data-file-name=\"분리배출_교사용.hwp\" data-file-size=\"70656\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DdSQv%26dataid%3D329%26fileid%3D7%26regdt%3D20240514091110&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F775b51c2b6443b39efa75299fc7bf15b41347a04_re_1715223949844')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">분리배출_교사용</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">69.00KB</div></div></a></div><p>3차시-조별 자료 조사 및 포스터 스케치</p><p>4,5차시-포스터 제작</p><p>6차시-포스터 제작 및 발표+평가서 작성</p><p>(포스터 제작이 일찍 끝난 조는 분리배출 o,x 퀴즈로 숨은 그림 찾기 진행)</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2591342028af63e0c6013aea37123885a7391285_re_1715223949844?download\" data-file-name=\"분리배출_퍼즐.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"122755\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DdSQv%26dataid%3D329%26fileid%3D8%26regdt%3D20240514091110&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F2591342028af63e0c6013aea37123885a7391285_re_1715223949844')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">분리배출_퍼즐</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">119.88KB</div></div></a></div><p>*포스터는 각 반에 게시하고 작품을 잘 만든 조는 1층 게시판에 게시</p><p>*발표 모습 및 포스터 작품</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/27c955105af9c4548bdb554db70ec32d93f53045_re_1715223949845\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/27c955105af9c4548bdb554db70ec32d93f53045_re_1715223949845\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e9158e7eb8114eada8dc6504300abf591b8a2d41_re_1715223949845\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e9158e7eb8114eada8dc6504300abf591b8a2d41_re_1715223949845\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/862a8d9d27032f687ab13573da1d1f488f8fe64e_re_1715223949845\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/862a8d9d27032f687ab13573da1d1f488f8fe64e_re_1715223949845\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattac